#def #lemma {useenv lemma}

#label(lemma:appx:0)
#lemma {
    Let $l_p^\theta(\Z,H_p^\gamma)$ be the space of all $H_p^\gamma$-valued
    sequences such that
    $$
        ||f||_{\gamma,p,\theta}^p = \sum_{n=-oo}^oo e^{n\theta}||f_n||_{\gamma,p}^p
        < oo.
    $$
    This space is a reflexive Banach space.
    \proof
    Consider a measure $\mu_\theta$ on $\Z$ by
    $$
        \int_\Z f(n)\mu_\theta(dn) \defeq \sum_{n=-oo}^oo e^{n\theta}f(n).
    $$
    Then $l_p^\theta(\Z,H_p^\gamma) = L_p(\Z,\mu_\theta,H_p^\gamma)$, and the
    latter space is a Banach space by the Bochner integeral theory.
}

